text = "WASD move    Shift sprint    Space jump (hold to auto-hop)
C or Ctrl slide (release mid-slide to slide-cancel)
Q slow-motion dive    LMB fire    RMB aim
Backspace restart    F3 hide this    Esc free mouse
In a browser use C to slide: Ctrl+W closes the tab.

Build speed: jump, then hold a strafe key and turn the
mouse the same way. Do not hold W in the air."
